<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian and Eritrean forces are massing troops along their shared border, raising fears of a new war. Clashes between Ethiopian militia and Somali Federalist Party supporters in Moyale have displaced thousands and prompted EU emergency aid of about Sh80 million. A drone strike near Badme wounded four civilians, while a study reports high rates of suicidal behavior among conflict-affected Ethiopian high schoolers. The conflict has already caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxNeEJBNVB0dkdmX1h1VU1fRTJkVGdQN3oyWWZlOTBqaFVPOHBIcWk2YlJ1M2poeFpLcWxlNV9rOHBQYTRwdzRaN2ZKbkNveGgyMkFBRmY1b2t4REJSampnVjdaZnlmYVA3Vm1oU0o5T093T0t0QjNQZU8xeHRzWGZRaERvVXJpUFNqZDhQcjZfSVFHSktmVGZ5anIzZWpxMXlfU0VqR2VybTFlSzl1R0M1R01IY1BEanRJSFJQQU5pLWFXMGs?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTE8zNTVaTFVVNVY0SUFBX1BrS05MM0kzUzluajhFZTcwdC02ekRERU5VbkZDajRNMUw3VmRSQVAyR1RoM1dNamNEVTJLR2Q5SXY2Q29aUEpDVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE5VUzBzZDdGOTFaZDRVZUdGRVpobjd6UUxsTnZOWFRuZVVCSEtvcUIxdnR6SU9xb3JQYlVFR3dmbDVuYVoyVld3VG1aYmpfZU5SSUN0dzgzQV8?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP Fact Check&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxNWmh3SHc2SjhYR2FJMWN1d3N5elVNMjJmaE1meVo1ZTlXaTVlTHQzaHdSM3djcEp5V0FIUU5UelBNRGVfRG5lY25pQ0hGVExGeXFDT0sxRXUzclpFTlYydk9teGU4NUp5WXdiUG9zMHRhUEpPLTlQcXFGSEVPMG1NR29pVFJ4YnZBTlliMmpR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nacionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPbk5yUjByMzJsRmpMYlFkbEJPRUlFNURiaExFYXR3eS1Gc3ZVR3libVdHdlI0Vld1VnlnR291aTVYWEVYVXhqblpuWGVabnlpc3JwYU5OaktuNGR6MU8yR